Private gpu-libm-bench dependencies. Updated by ../update_nvbench.sh.

NVBench a7fe2f3d47980a48a21dac5d407dd8eff007dfc4 (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception)
RAPIDS CMake v25.12.00 (Apache-2.0)
