CPM.cmake v0.42.0 (MIT, license embedded in CPM.cmake)

Upstream sources are retained for the build; tests and unrelated tooling are
omitted. ../nvbench-local.patch prevents an embedded NVBench from replacing
the enclosing project's compile_commands.json with a symlink. No math code or
timing implementation is patched. All fetching happens in the update script;
runner/CMakeLists.txt directs upstream dependency lookups to local sources.
